# ==========================================
# MIT Racecar Neo Workspace - .gitignore
# 只保留源代码，忽略编译产物、临时文件与系统杂文件
# ==========================================

# --- Unity WebGL 编译产物 (Build Output) ---
# 注意：Unity 编译出的 WebGL 部署文件（体积较重，无需纳入源码版本控制）
# EXCEPTION: frontend.data and frontend.wasm ARE tracked — they are required
# for GitHub Pages deployment and were previously handled by Git LFS.
# The LFS bandwidth quota was exhausted in CI, so they're now regular git files.
ide/frontend/Build/*
!ide/frontend/Build/frontend.data
!ide/frontend/Build/frontend.wasm
Build/
Builds/

# --- Unity 项目临时与工程生成文件 (Unity Generated Files) ---
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]serSettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Aa]ssetPacks/
sysinfo.txt
*.apk
*.unitypackage

# --- IDE 与编辑器项目文件 (Visual Studio / VSCode / JetBrains) ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
.idea/
*.sln
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.opendb
*.idb

# --- Python 缓存与虚拟环境 (Python Cache & Virtual Envs) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/

# --- 临时草稿与运行日志 (Scratch & Logs) ---
ide/frontend/scratch/
*.log
*.tmp
*.csv

# --- 操作系统临时文件 (OS System Files) ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
